@startuml
hide footbox
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequence {
  ArrowColor black
  LifeLineBorderColor #90A4AE
  ParticipantBackgroundColor #E8F4FD
  ParticipantBorderColor #2196F3
  ParticipantFontColor #1565C0
}
skinparam noteBackgroundColor #FFF8E1
skinparam noteBorderColor #F9A825

title ttt — a session, from HELLO to the verdict

participant "player X" as X
participant "server (the authority)" as S
participant "player O" as O

X -> S : HELLO
S --> X : SEAT X
S --> X : STATE 123456789
note over S : a QUESTION is answered — to the asker only

O -> S : HELLO
S --> O : SEAT O
S --> O : STATE 123456789

X -> S : MOVE 1
S --> X : STATE X23456789
S --> O : STATE X23456789
note over S : an accepted move is a CHANGE —\nthe new board is broadcast to everyone

... O plays 4 · X plays 2 · O plays 5 ...

X -> S : MOVE 3
S --> X : STATE XXXOO6789
S --> O : STATE XXXOO6789
S --> X : BYE
S --> O : BYE
note over S : the winning move ends the game:\nfinal board, then BYE — both broadcast.\nThe server exits; nothing lingers.
@enduml
